// The Sentry DSN for the app target (#222). The real value is never committed.
//
// Locally: create Config/Sentry.local.xcconfig (git-ignored), copied from
// Sentry.local.xcconfig.example. On Xcode Cloud, ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh
// writes that file from the SENTRY_DSN secret.
//
// An xcconfig reads "//" as the start of a comment, so the DSN's two slashes are
// written as $(SLASH)$(SLASH).
SLASH = /
SENTRY_DSN =
#include? "Sentry.local.xcconfig"
